@startuml 궁합요청_수락

autonumber

actor Author as A
participant BoardUI as B
participant "CompatibilityController\n(Flask API)" as CC
participant "CompatibilityService" as CS
participant "CompatibilityRepository" as CR
participant "UserRepository" as UR
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC
database DB

A -> B: 요청 알림 확인
B -> CC: POST /compatibility/requests/{request_id}/response {accept: true/false}
CC -> CC: require_auth() - 토큰 검증
CC -> CC: get_current_user() - 현재 사용자 확인
CC -> CS: accept_compatibility(request_id, actor_id, accept)
CS -> CR: get(request_id)
CR -> DB: SELECT compatibility_request WHERE request_id = ?
DB --> CR: request record
CR --> CS: request data
alt 요청 없음
  CS --> CC: NotFoundError
  CC --> B: 404 Not Found
  B --> A: 요청을 찾을 수 없음
else 요청 존재
  CS -> CS: 상태 확인 (pending인지)
  CS -> CS: 권한 확인 (actor_id == target_id)
  alt accept == true
    CS -> UR: get_by_id(requester_id)
    UR -> DB: SELECT user WHERE user_id = ?
    DB --> UR: requester user
    UR --> CS: requester data
    CS -> UR: get_by_id(target_id)
    UR -> DB: SELECT user WHERE user_id = ?
    DB --> UR: target user
    UR --> CS: target data
    CS -> CS: _load_saju(requester) - JSON 파싱
    CS -> CS: _load_saju(target) - JSON 파싱
    CS -> SC: calculate_compatibility(saju1, saju2, gender1, gender2)
    SC --> CS: {original, final, stress}
    CS -> CS: _build_description(final_score)
    CS -> CR: set_response(request_id, accept=True, scores, description)
  else accept == false
    CS -> CS: description = "요청이 거절되었습니다."
    CS -> CR: set_response(request_id, accept=False, scores=None, description)
  end
  CR -> DB: UPDATE compatibility_request SET status, result_original, result_final, stress, compatibility_result
  DB --> CR: ok
  CS -> CS: 알림 생성 (compatibility_resolved)
  CS -> CR: get(request_id) - 업데이트된 요청 조회
  CR -> DB: SELECT compatibility_request WHERE request_id = ?
  DB --> CR: updated request
  CR --> CS: updated request data
  CS --> CC: request data
  CC --> B: 200 OK
  B --> A: 결과 표시
end

@enduml

